      "content": "that's what everyone says, but it feels like a lie. it feels like a cycle that just keeps looping. if the fight was never mine to win, then why does everyone insist on keeping me in the ring? it feels more like a mercy to just leave the fight entirely. don't you think there's a point where it just makes more sense to stop?",
